Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.99,0:00:06.74,Default,KnightA,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.14,0:00:08.67,Default,KnightA,0,0,0,,It's an army of monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.67,0:00:09.94,Default,KnightB,0,0,0,,The stampede's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:14.02,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,Aid from the castle didn't \Nmake it in time...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.65,0:00:16.41,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,All units!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:20.02,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,We will join with the adventurers' guild \Nand defend our defensive line with our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:25.58,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,May the blessing of the spirits \Nbe with the Kingdom of Palettia!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.58,0:00:28.81,Default,Knights,0,0,0,,May the blessing of the spirits \Nbe with the Kingdom of Palettia!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.59,0:02:01.97,Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fad(2025,1)\pos(320,20)\blur2}The Magical Revolution
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.59,0:02:01.97,Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fad(2025,1)\pos(320,20)\blur2\clip(m 116 13 l 113 58 331 59 328 30 310 58 116 56 120 14 238 18 218 44 192 6 357 14 332 43 331 5 535 5 525 55 473 55 492 25)}The {\c&H7A4AE4&}Mag{\c&HE38B59&}ical {\c&H7A4AE4&}Revol{\c&HE38B59&}ution
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.59,0:02:01.97,Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fad(2025,1)\fs15\pos(320,56)\blur2}of the {\c&H7A4AE4&}Reincarnated Princess {\c&H140900&}and the {\c&HE38B59&}Genius Young Lady
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.19,0:02:06.48,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,There they are. Can we get there in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:07.65,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.65,0:02:11.10,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Yeah. I want to get those materials \Nwhile they're in good shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:12.29,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,We gotta hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.29,0:02:15.56,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you seem so \Ncalm about this, Miss Anis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.80,0:02:19.74,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, this robe is \Nmade of special materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:22.43,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Oh, if you're cold, you can stick closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:24.40,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,No, that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.22,0:02:30.42,Flashback,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.67,0:02:35.86,Flashback,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Before we leave, there's \Nsomething I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:39.04,Flashback,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Why do you want the dragon's magicite?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:40.76,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.38,0:02:43.65,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,So I can be a magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:49.70,Flashback,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,What does that have to do with magicite?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:52.15,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I haven't told many people about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.43,0:02:57.10,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,But using magicite allows you to use a \Npower that's basically pseudo-magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.41,0:03:00.31,Flashback,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Using it... how?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.57,0:03:05.47,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Oh, well... You need a biological \Nmedium to serve as a catalyst.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.47,0:03:07.29,Flashback,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,A biological medium?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.29,0:03:07.95,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.39,0:03:12.25,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Which is why I had the idea \Nto implant the magicite in my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.24,0:03:15.41,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I've done lots of clinical tests already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.41,0:03:16.95,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,There are no safety issues...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.27,0:03:18.34,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:21.81,Flashback,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Your magicology is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:24.59,Flashback,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,And your magic tools are \Ndesigned to help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.59,0:03:29.69,Flashback,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,But any arts performed using \Nmagicite seem frightening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.69,0:03:31.12,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,That's fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:35.55,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It might just be a way to \Nturn myself into a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.69,0:03:40.56,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,But since I can't use magic the regular way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.56,0:03:42.19,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,it's my only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:45.61,Flashback,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Because that's all I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.45,0:03:58.15,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It's started! Let's hurry, Euphie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:03:59.89,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.58,0:04:20.02,Default,Young,0,0,0,,Leader?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.02,0:04:22.67,Default,Veteran,0,0,0,,Leave this one to me! Get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.29,0:04:26.38,Default,Veteran,0,0,0,,Help from the capital is never \Ngonna make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:28.42,Default,Veteran,0,0,0,,You gotta survive, even if I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:35.72,Default,Young,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:39.83,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Move it! Move it! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:48.34,Default,Veteran,0,0,0,,This must be a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.67,0:04:52.05,Default,Veteran,0,0,0,,Hah! I guess only you could get here \Nfrom the capital in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.40,0:04:54.53,Default,Veteran,0,0,0,,The plundering princess of the hunt...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.53,0:04:57.02,Default,Veteran,0,0,0,,The Marauder Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.19,0:05:02.89,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,Princess Anisphia?! And Lady Magenta?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.89,0:05:05.87,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain. Been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:07.60,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,So where do we stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:11.14,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,We've managed to hold the \Nstampede back thus far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.14,0:05:12.32,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,But the problem is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.65,0:05:15.38,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,The dragon behind it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:19.33,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.60,0:05:23.03,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Then you can leave the dragon to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.03,0:05:26.77,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'm basically the only flying \Nfighter this kingdom has.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.77,0:05:27.76,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.98,0:05:30.08,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,Rather... Are you {\i1}sane{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:32.37,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I am serious, and I'm quite sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.74,0:05:35.52,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,So while I'm taking care of the dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:39.19,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I want all of you and Euphie \Nto hold the stampede back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:41.89,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.25,0:05:43.83,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Okay, make it happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.02,0:05:48.32,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:52.42,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,You intend to take on the dragon alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:54.86,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Well, it'll be an aerial battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.86,0:05:57.32,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I doubt you have any experience with those,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.32,0:06:00.72,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,and the stampede's too dangerous \Nfor the knights to stop on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:04.24,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,This is just the most effective way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.24,0:06:06.05,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,You understand, don't you, Euphie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:11.61,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,There are some things I can't agree with, \Neven if I do understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:15.59,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:18.83,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.83,0:06:24.08,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:26.36,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Okay, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:29.78,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.78,0:06:31.69,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,A product of my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.69,0:06:34.29,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,They're pills made with crushed magicite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:36.38,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I call it "magic medicine."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.38,0:06:37.47,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Magic—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.47,0:06:40.32,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,It basically works like \Nstamina-boosting magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.32,0:06:42.07,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,It's not what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.36,0:06:45.91,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It does have a few little side effects, \Nbut don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:48.19,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Those {\i1}are{\i0} safe to use, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.19,0:06:50.04,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It's fine! They're legal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.04,0:06:53.93,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,They kinda make you feel hyper \Nand lose your sense of reason, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:56.09,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,And how is that "fine"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:20.93,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.93,0:07:22.20,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'm fine, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.07,0:07:28.01,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm gonna take out some of the \Nsmall fry while I wait for the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.21,0:07:33.86,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.55,0:07:40.74,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It's time for a super-fun materials hunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.91,0:08:15.14,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.87,0:08:25.97,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.69,0:08:30.16,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Grant me now a cage of scorching heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.66,0:08:32.31,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Incantation magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.69,0:08:37.15,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Envelop everything I see before my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:39.65,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,and reduce it all to embers!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:43.92,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:09:00.08,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Euphie's magic is so amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:06.76,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,So this... is real magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.47,0:09:35.01,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,That's... the dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.90,0:09:37.28,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It's so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.28,0:09:38.90,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.13,0:09:41.60,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Amazing! Absolutely amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.98,0:09:44.14,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,To think such creatures exist...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:46.53,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,The world never ceases to amaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.37,0:09:48.68,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Hey, Euphie...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:52.18,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,If I had that dragon's magicite,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.68,0:09:55.93,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,what do you think I'd be able to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.02,0:10:03.87,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.87,0:10:06.33,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll be back soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:13.70,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.30,0:10:27.77,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:32.55,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,And now... take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:37.54,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:41.70,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,My blade won't cut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.18,0:10:43.47,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,What is that thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.99,0:10:47.61,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,The Mana Blade—a sword whose \Nblade is generated by mana—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:51.32,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,is my prized invention that cuts through \Nboth physical and magical bodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.93,0:11:03.39,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Okay, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.79,0:11:10.40,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:22.54,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.08,0:11:51.14,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Euphie...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:02.69,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Faster... Move faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.29,0:12:04.94,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I have to get to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.34,0:12:08.11,DefaultItalics,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Like she did for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.85,0:12:36.44,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.44,0:12:38.16,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis! Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:42.87,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Euphie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.27,0:12:53.43,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I still have...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:01.50,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Euphie?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:04.96,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,You mean to continue fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.62,0:13:09.19,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,You almost died just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.19,0:13:12.69,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Why would you... go to such lengths for...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:18.95,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It's a simple reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.78,0:13:23.52,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Because that's what I feel \Na magician should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.73,0:13:30.48,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,That thing takes people's smiles away. \NIt can't be allowed to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.48,0:13:32.22,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,That's why I fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:37.96,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,The ideal magician in my mind \Nalways uses magic to make people smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:42.42,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,If I run away now, I can't call \Nmyself a magician anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.85,0:13:47.77,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.48,0:13:54.70,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,But if the way you feel is what \Nallows me to stay here...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.70,0:13:57.22,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I want to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.29,0:13:59.89,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,That's why I don't want to let you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.89,0:14:01.89,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I don't want you to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.27,0:14:05.75,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,If not going now means you \Nwon't be yourself anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:08.38,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,then please, at least take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.73,0:14:10.74,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I won't get in your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:13.32,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I want to understand your magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.32,0:14:15.71,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,If you're worried about the flying, \NI've got the hang of it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:18.11,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I can assist you! I can defend!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.11,0:14:20.21,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I can be your support!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.45,0:14:25.16,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,So... So please...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.40,0:14:29.84,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Don't go alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:41.13,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Okay. I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.35,0:14:45.34,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,But I do have to stop that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.29,0:14:48.53,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,So I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.10,0:14:52.36,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,But you're right. It'll be tough alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.28,0:14:56.32,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,So I'll ask you myself, Euphie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.29,0:15:00.76,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Will you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.83,0:15:11.55,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,If that's what you want, \NI will accompany you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.12,0:15:16.26,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:20.00,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Let's go dragon-hunting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.74,0:15:29.76,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis, I believe the dragon has \Ncovered itself with a magic barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:31.16,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,A magic barrier...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.49,0:15:32.57,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,So that's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:36.78,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Thanks, Euphie. Do you know \Na way we can get around it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:40.36,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Would it be too difficult \Nto get around behind it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.66,0:15:43.49,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,For a body that large to sustain flight,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.49,0:15:45.82,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,it must have its own unique magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.12,0:15:48.59,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,And what's making that possible should be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.59,0:15:49.81,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Its wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.79,0:15:59.62,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Euphie, the only way to get behind that thing\N is to shoot straight for it at top speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:00.52,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:01.17,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:03.64,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'm putting my life in your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:05.61,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I accepted that long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.89,0:16:11.31,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Our target is its wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.20,0:16:19.63,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Wind Cutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.05,0:16:24.01,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.41,0:16:26.91,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Wind Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.89,0:16:46.28,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,This time...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:50.14,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,You're the one who's gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.63,0:17:01.08,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Cut! Cut! Cut! Cut! Cut! Cut! Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.08,0:17:04.15,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Cut it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.25,0:17:12.42,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.42,0:17:13.54,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.35,0:17:16.58,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Nice catch, Euphie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.09,0:17:49.79,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis, we should retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.79,0:17:51.79,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's defini—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.74,0:17:54.78,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.17,0:18:01.33,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,If we dodge it, that entire area \Nwill be mowed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.64,0:18:11.94,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis, what are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:14.15,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'm going to cut that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.98,0:18:17.61,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,You can't do that! It's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.61,0:18:19.03,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,That thing is magic, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:21.58,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,And if it's a pure mana shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.07,0:18:24.30,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,my blade should be able to cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.78,0:18:29.17,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Mana Blade...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:31.67,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Release limiter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.44,0:18:44.69,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.69,0:18:48.76,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,If I can't show you that the \Nimpossible can be made possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.76,0:18:50.65,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I can't call myself a magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.49,0:18:56.56,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.41,0:19:02.99,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Show me, then. I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.41,0:19:06.71,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I'll be watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.98,0:19:22.31,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Just how dense is this mass of mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.31,0:19:25.14,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,But still, I have to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:27.26,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,This is no ordinary sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.26,0:19:29.25,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It's my own magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.25,0:19:32.60,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It's the infinite potential \Nthat I've envisioned
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:34.86,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,since the moment I became who I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.35,0:19:38.31,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,The impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.74,0:19:43.57,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,is meant to be made possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.59,0:20:02.28,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I-It's over...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.53,0:20:07.96,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.27,0:20:23.23,Default,Dragon,0,0,0,,Well done, visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:25.99,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Do you mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.99,0:20:28.38,Default,Dragon,0,0,0,,You are victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:32.27,Default,Dragon,0,0,0,,Do as you please with my corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.27,0:20:33.63,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:37.93,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. You resent me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.52,0:20:40.14,Default,Dragon,0,0,0,,Resent you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:47.56,Default,Dragon,0,0,0,,How truly amusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.56,0:20:50.55,Default,Dragon,0,0,0,,In that case, engrave this \Nupon your very soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.55,0:20:53.56,Default,Dragon,0,0,0,,My existence, the symbol of my being...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:57.01,Default,Dragon,0,0,0,,Carry their weight upon your \Nshoulders for all eternity!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:01.73,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,What... is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.73,0:21:04.54,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It's like words... or wisdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:11.37,DefaultItalics,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It's been carved into me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.66,0:21:16.10,Default,Dragon,0,0,0,,Ah, you who succeeded in slaying me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.47,0:21:19.32,Default,Dragon,0,0,0,,May you... May you forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.89,0:21:23.05,Default,Dragon,0,0,0,,bear this curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.46,0:21:49.65,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Victory parties are such a drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.23,0:21:52.84,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,I just can't handle this kind of atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.84,0:21:54.03,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Miss Anis?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.74,0:21:57.99,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Oh, Euphie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.99,0:22:00.23,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I noticed you were nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.23,0:22:02.98,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,So this is where you ran away to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:05.50,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,What about you? Why are you out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.84,0:22:09.46,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,As a noble, I may be an accomplished dancer,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.84,0:22:13.96,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,but in truth, I find contact with men \Nto be a bit oppressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.65,0:22:21.23,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,Dance with me, Euphie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.58,0:22:25.71,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,It's not as if you hate dancing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.03,0:22:27.98,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,So it's a waste not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.76,0:22:31.27,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,A waste, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.76,0:22:50.62,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,If you hadn't taken me away that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.04,0:22:54.76,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I might have cried and cried \Nuntil my spirit was broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.59,0:22:57.96,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,But you took me away from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.71,0:23:00.75,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I was so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.75,0:23:04.12,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,You gave me a new opportunity \Nafter I'd failed at everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.12,0:23:05.95,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.93,0:23:14.87,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll do more reckless things in \Nthe future, just like slaying that dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.37,0:23:18.57,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,You are someone precious\Nthat I can't let out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.34,0:23:24.28,Default,Euphyllia,0,0,0,,I hope you will continue to keep me \Nby your side, Miss Anis.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.81,0:23:31.57,Default,Anisphia,0,0,0,,And I hope you'll always \Nstay with me, Euphie!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:34.97,Next Episode Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,114)}Episode Five\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\fs25}A Magic Medicine and a Magic Sword \NSubjugate a Magic Dragon
